WEBVTT

00:00:00.678 --> 00:00:04.129
Tutorial three. Inclusion rules and subsets.

00:00:08.472 --> 00:00:17.031
Build your inclusion criteria as rules. Each rule has a column, an operator and a value. Add as many as your protocol needs.

00:00:17.332 --> 00:00:25.427
Each rule shows how many rows remain, and how many each group lost. It is a live version of the participant flow diagram.

00:00:25.661 --> 00:00:28.834
The group counts in the sidebar follow every change.

00:00:29.117 --> 00:00:37.491
Subsets run a complete analysis for each value. Here, one preset gives a full PRK analysis and a full LASIK analysis.

00:00:37.767 --> 00:00:44.004
Preview the rows that will be analysed. You can export them as a CSV file to keep with the manuscript.

00:00:44.803 --> 00:00:49.275
StandardEyes. For ophthalmologists, by ophthalmologists.

